# Kept out of the Flux OCI artifact: these run in CI, never in the cluster. Everything the
# cluster reads lives in infra/, platform/, apps/, environments/ and clusters/.
/.github/
/updatecli/
# The checks themselves, and the rules they run. Rendering, diffing, the binding check and
# the size-profile assertions all read this repo from outside it; nothing in the cluster
# reads them back.
/tests/
/policy/
# The size-profile measuring tool and its pinned chart cache. `measure.py` renders and adds
# up what a profile asks the scheduler for; it belongs in CI, and `.charts/` is hundreds of
# megabytes of upstream Helm charts that must never travel in the config artifact.
/measure.py
/.charts/
